  "transcriptHtml": "<h2 style='margin-top:0; border-bottom:2px solid var(--primary-blue); padding-bottom:6px;'>LISTENING TRANSCRIPT - PART 4</h2><div class='transcript-line' data-time='1384'><span class='time-stamp-tag'>23:04</span>Much of the world now lives in an industrial civilization...</div><div class='transcript-line' data-time='1402'><span class='time-stamp-tag'>23:22</span><span class='hl' id='hl-q31' data-q='[Q31]'>One of these is <span class='kw'>metal</span>. Without that, we'd have no machines and no transportation</span>.</div><div class='transcript-line' data-time='1477'><span class='time-stamp-tag'>24:37</span><span class='hl' id='hl-q32' data-q='[Q32]'>So, cultivating them's a <span class='kw'>slow</span> process</span>.</div><div class='transcript-line' data-time='1494'><span class='time-stamp-tag'>24:54</span><span class='hl' id='hl-q33' data-q='[Q33]'>if they find the <span class='kw'>demand</span> for that crop is rising or falling</span>.</div><div class='transcript-line' data-time='1527'><span class='time-stamp-tag'>25:27</span><span class='hl' id='hl-q34' data-q='[Q34]'>The result is that it can't be grown in the northern or southern parts of the globe, only around the <span class='kw'>equator</span></span>.</div><div class='transcript-line' data-time='1575'><span class='time-stamp-tag'>26:15</span><span class='hl' id='hl-q35' data-q='[Q35]'>But although this is also possible with rubber, it's very difficult, so that also reduces the amount we have available</span>.</div><div class='transcript-line' data-time='1614'><span class='time-stamp-tag'>26:54</span><span class='hl' id='hl-q36' data-q='[Q36]'>The most dangerous threat is a <span class='kw'>fungus</span> which destroyed large numbers of rubber trees in Brazil</span>.</div><div class='transcript-line' data-time='1645'><span class='time-stamp-tag'>27:25</span><span class='hl' id='hl-q37' data-q='[Q37]'>And finally, in recent years, Southeast Asia, like other parts of the world, has been repeatedly hit by extreme types of <span class='kw'>weather</span></span>.</div><div class='transcript-line' data-time='1680'><span class='time-stamp-tag'>28:00</span><span class='hl' id='hl-q38' data-q='[Q38]'>but compared with natural rubber, it's not anything like as <span class='kw'>strong</span></span>.</div><div class='transcript-line' data-time='1729'><span class='time-stamp-tag'>28:49</span><span class='hl' id='hl-q39' data-q='[Q39]'>But when it's pulled up and its <span class='kw'>roots</span> cut open, they are found to contain rubber</span>.</div><div class='transcript-line' data-time='1746'><span class='time-stamp-tag'>29:06</span><span class='hl' id='hl-q40' data-q='[Q40]'>They'll grow in all sorts of places, and they don't need rich <span class='kw'>soil</span></span>.</div>",
  "questionHtml": "<h3 style='color: var(--primary-blue); font-size: 1.15em; margin-top: 5px;'>Questions 31-40</h3><p><i>Complete the notes below. Write <b>ONE WORD ONLY</b> for each answer.</i></p><div style='background: var(--bg-subcard); border: 1.5px solid var(--border-color); padding: 22px; border-radius: 8px;'><h4 style='color: var(--primary-blue); margin-top: 0;'>Sources of rubber</h4><ul><li class='question' id='q31'>• <b>31.</b> <input type='text' id='q31_input' class='fill-input'><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> metal / metals</div></li><li>• fossil fuels</li><li>• rubber</li></ul><h4 style='color: var(--primary-blue);'>Natural rubber</h4><ul><li class='question' id='q32'>• growth is <b>32.</b> <input type='text' id='q32_input' class='fill-input'><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> slow</div></li><li class='question' id='q33'>• cannot easily be adjusted because of <b>33.</b> <input type='text' id='q33_input' class='fill-input'><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> demand</div></li><li class='question' id='q34'>• only grows near the <b>34.</b> <input type='text' id='q34_input' class='fill-input'><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> equator</div></li><li class='question' id='q35'>• difficult to <b>35.</b> <input type='text' id='q35_input' class='fill-input'> rubber<div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> recycle</div></li></ul><h4 style='color: var(--primary-blue);'>New threats</h4><ul><li class='question' id='q36'>• disease caused by a <b>36.</b> <input type='text' id='q36_input' class='fill-input'><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> fungus</div></li><li class='question' id='q37'>• extreme <b>37.</b> <input type='text' id='q37_input' class='fill-input'> events<div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> weather</div></li></ul><h4 style='color: var(--primary-blue);'>Synthetic rubber</h4><ul><li class='question' id='q38'>• is less <b>38.</b> <input type='text' id='q38_input' class='fill-input'> than natural rubber<div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> strong</div></li></ul><h4 style='color: var(--primary-blue);'>Alternative source</h4><ul><li class='question' id='q39'>• dandelion rubber in its <b>39.</b> <input type='text' id='q39_input' class='fill-input'><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> roots</div></li><li class='question' id='q40'>• does not require good <b>40.</b> <input type='text' id='q40_input' class='fill-input'><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> soil</div></li></ul></div><button class='btn-submit' onclick='checkAnswers()'>CHẤM BÀI VÀ NỘP KẾT QUẢ</button>"
